  "description": "Overview\n\nThe Iconic EVO TR 2 Speed is a full‑suspension, Class‑3 eBike that blends XC mountain‑bike capability with urban adventure features like integrated fenders, rack, and lights—perfect for effortlessly navigating both city streets and weekend tours. Its Bosch Performance Speed drive and 625 Wh PowerTube give you powerful pedal‑assist up to 28 mph and long-range riding, all wrapped in a sleek, trail‑ready package.\n\nMotor and Battery\n\nMotor: The Gen4 Performance Speed motor delivers up to 85 Nm of torque and pedal assist up to 28 mph, giving you smooth and consistent power on commutes, bike paths, and everything in between.\n\nBattery: The 625Wh PowerTube battery is fully integrated into the down tube and delivers hours of ride time with a full recharge in about 5 hours.\n\nSuspension and Frame\n\nFork: The SR Suntour Lytro 35 Supreme SL Boost offers 120mm of travel for confident handling and bump absorption on mixed surfaces.\n\nFrame: Built with lightweight 6061 aluminum and internal cable routing for a clean look. Frame sizes range from S to XL for a dialed fit.\n\nDrivetrain and Brakes\n\nGearing: A Shimano Deore 10-speed drivetrain gives you the range and reliability you need to tackle climbs and pick up speed on flats.\n\nBrakes: Tektro HD-M530 hydraulic disc brakes (203mm front, 180mm rear) provide powerful, consistent stopping in all conditions.\n\nWheels and Tires\n\nWheels: 27.5\" wheels strike the perfect balance between maneuverability and road grip.\n\nTires: Outfitted with Supero All Ground 2.4\" tires that offer dependable traction and control on pavement, gravel, or light trails.\n\nAdditional Features\n\nDisplay: The compact and full-color Kiox display gives you all your ride data at a glance—speed, battery level, trip distance, and more.\n\nPedals and Saddle: Comes with grippy Wellgo C-098DU pedals and a comfort-focused Selle Royal Iconic saddle for long-mile ease.\n\nTechnology and Design\n\nMonkeyLink Ready: Easily clip in compatible lights, fenders, and racks—no tools required.\n\nClass-3 eBike: Pedal-assist up to 28 mph means you're ready for urban streets and long rides alike.\n\nWho It’s For\n\nThe Iconic EVO TR 2 Speed is ideal for riders who want a sleek, high-speed eBike packed with comfort and commuting range—built to glide through traffic or take on big weekend rides without skipping a beat.",
